    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\".2em\" columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
